  <entity00126380:DescriptionOfDeductibleTemporaryDifferencesRelatedToInvestmentToSubsidiariesAssociatesAndJointVenturesOfDisclosureOfTemporaryDifferenceUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCreditsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTemporaryDifferenceUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCreditsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TemporaryDifferenceUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCreditsAxis_ifrs-full_InvestmentsAccountedForUsingEquityMethodMember" xml:lang="ko">종속기업, 관계기업 및 공동기업 투자와 관련된 차감할 일시적차이 중 예측가능한 미래에 소멸할 가능성이 높지 않을 경우 이연법인세자산을 인식하지 않았습니다.</entity00126380:DescriptionOfDeductibleTemporaryDifferencesRelatedToInvestmentToSubsidiariesAssociatesAndJointVenturesOfDisclosureOfTemporaryDifferenceUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCreditsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTemporaryDifferenceUnusedTaxLossesAndUnusedTaxCreditsTableOfItems>
