  <ifrs-full:InformationOnHowEntityDeterminedThatFinancialAssetsAreCreditimpairedFinancialAssets contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_dart_ReceivablesMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_ifrs-full_GrossCarryingAmountMember_ifrs-full_PastDueStatusAxis_ifrs-full_NotLaterThanOneMonthMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 31일 이하 연체된 미수금은 신용위험이 유의적으로 증가하였다고
판단하지 않습니다.</ifrs-full:InformationOnHowEntityDeterminedThatFinancialAssetsAreCreditimpairedFinancialAssets>
  <ifrs-full:InformationOnHowEntityDeterminedThatFinancialAssetsAreCreditimpairedFinancialAssets contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_TradeReceivablesMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_ifrs-full_GrossCarryingAmountMember_ifrs-full_PastDueStatusAxis_ifrs-full_NotLaterThanOneMonthMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 31일 이하 연체된 매출채권은 신용위험이 유의적으로 증가하였다고
판단하지 않습니다.</ifrs-full:InformationOnHowEntityDeterminedThatFinancialAssetsAreCreditimpairedFinancialAssets>
  <ifrs-full:InformationOnHowEntityDeterminedThatFinancialAssetsAreCreditimpairedFinancialAssets contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialAssetsAxis_dart_ReceivablesMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_ifrs-full_GrossCarryingAmountMember_ifrs-full_PastDueStatusAxis_ifrs-full_NotLaterThanOneMonthMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 31일 이하 연체된 미수금은 신용위험이 유의적으로 증가하였다고
