  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfMainEventsAndCircumstancesThatLedToRecognitionOfImpairmentLossesAndReversalsOfImpairmentLosses contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsAxis_ifrs-full_IndividualAssetsOrCashgeneratingUnitsMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfAssetsAxis_ifrs-full_GoodwillMember_ifrs-full_SegmentsAxis_entity00126380_DsDivisionMemberOfReportableSegmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfImpairmentLossRecognisedOrReversedForCashGeneratingUnitTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">서비스 및 기술 환경 변화에 따른 사업성 하락으로 DS부문의 영업권에 대해 96,008백만원의 손상차손을 당기 중 인식하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfMainEventsAndCircumstancesThatLedToRecognitionOfImpairmentLossesAndReversalsOfImpairmentLosses>
